  "creator": "CrossFit",
  "description": "A 1,500 m row, 2 rounds of 53 push-ups, 11 pull-ups, 5 shoulder presses at 135/95 lb, a 100 m farmers carry, a 50 m sled push and a 300 m sprint, then another 1,500 m row. Honours U.S. Army Chief Warrant Officer 2 Jonathan Farmer, 5th Special Forces Group, killed in an attack in Manbij, Syria, in 2019. Scale the press to a strict load you can do for five.",
